WEBVTT

00:30.100 --> 00:32.220
I did it, Master Tomoka.

00:32.220 --> 00:35.980
M-Mimi-chan, it's embarrassing when you call me that.

00:38.150 --> 00:39.810
I won't let you pass, Nee-sama!

00:39.810 --> 00:40.980
Oh!

00:40.980 --> 00:42.480
I won't lose, either.

00:44.280 --> 00:45.900
Everyone's doing so well.

00:45.900 --> 00:49.910
Yeah, but it'd be perfect if we could get all ten.

00:49.910 --> 00:52.410
We're still missing those three, right?

01:13.810 --> 01:15.140
Hey, you know...

01:15.140 --> 01:19.480
Since you both lost, why don't you just join in on the Basketball Club's practice?

01:19.480 --> 01:20.230
Forget about it!

01:20.520 --> 01:22.900
This is <i>our</i> problem!

01:22.900 --> 01:24.270
So shut up, Nii-tan!

01:24.270 --> 01:28.280
Can you two beat all of the others by yourselves?

01:42.580 --> 01:44.840
N-No way.

01:46.590 --> 01:48.380
You're all too weak.

01:48.380 --> 01:53.970
Even if you try ten thousand times, you two still won't be able to beat me.

01:53.970 --> 01:55.350
Later.

01:59.940 --> 02:02.600
We couldn't do anything.

02:02.850 --> 02:05.110
We'll definitely get our revenge!

02:05.110 --> 02:06.110
Yeah.

02:52.430 --> 02:55.520
Make them see that halation!

02:55.520 --> 02:58.940
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

02:58.940 --> 03:02.020
Spread out, new formation!

03:02.020 --> 03:05.490
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

03:05.490 --> 03:11.780
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

03:12.070 --> 03:16.700
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

03:16.700 --> 03:18.370
Leave it to me.

03:18.370 --> 03:24.920
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

03:24.920 --> 03:31.220
I remember each and every granted wish,

03:31.220 --> 03:37.100
including that day I cried in secret.

03:37.100 --> 03:40.600
We're not the only ones

03:40.600 --> 03:44.150
seeing these same dreams.

03:44.150 --> 03:47.780
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

03:47.780 --> 03:50.910
that appeared in front of me,

03:50.910 --> 03:52.490
let them fly!

03:52.780 --> 03:55.910
Make them see that halation!

03:55.910 --> 03:59.250
Run into that open space!

03:59.250 --> 04:05.880
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

04:05.880 --> 04:12.430
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

04:12.430 --> 04:18.720
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

04:21.990 --> 04:24.910
A new menu for the S-Grade Gourmet Fair?

04:24.910 --> 04:25.700
Yes.

04:25.700 --> 04:30.160
We've decided to enter the Suzuran Shopping Street's contest.

04:30.160 --> 04:33.000
And we'll think up the menu ourselves!

04:33.000 --> 04:34.790
Sounds fun!

04:34.790 --> 04:36.250
Oh!

04:36.250 --> 04:38.290
I'll think, too!

04:38.290 --> 04:42.760
I'm sure we'll make a delicious menu when we pool our ideas together!

04:42.760 --> 04:43.550
Yep!

04:43.550 --> 04:47.220
Okay! Let's meet up at Saki's house then!

04:47.220 --> 04:49.260
Yeah!

04:53.310 --> 04:56.020
They should all be getting here about right now...

05:04.320 --> 05:05.910
Why aren't you coming to practice?

05:07.160 --> 05:09.030
I can do whatever I want.

05:09.030 --> 05:13.040
I only play basketball to beat you, Saki.

05:13.040 --> 05:15.920
But you can't play basketball all by yourself.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.540
Stop being so hard on yourself.

05:17.540 --> 05:18.920
It's always like this!

05:18.920 --> 05:20.710
We're only one year apart!

05:20.710 --> 05:22.130
Stop acting like the Onee-san!

05:23.670 --> 05:24.720
Masami...

05:25.010 --> 05:26.590
I won't lose next time!

05:26.590 --> 05:28.220
In basketball or in anything else!

05:28.590 --> 05:30.100
The S-Grade Gourmet Fair, too!

05:30.100 --> 05:34.350
I'll be helping out at Sushi Fuji this year.

05:34.350 --> 05:36.270
Sushi Fuji vs Nagatsuka.

05:36.270 --> 05:38.690
A duel between me and you!

05:42.980 --> 05:45.990
Can all of you help me out?

05:45.990 --> 05:49.410
The sixth-years are helping out at Nagatsuka.

05:49.410 --> 05:50.990
This is a great chance to get our revenge!

05:52.120 --> 05:57.420
But we want to get revenge on that girl first, rather than Maho.

05:57.420 --> 05:58.870
That girl?

05:58.870 --> 06:01.500
She's really good at basketball and she pisses us off!

06:01.500 --> 06:04.960
But seeing a gloating Maho is pretty bad, too.

06:04.960 --> 06:09.800
Tsuba, let's team up with Masami for now and beat Maho to a pulp!

06:09.800 --> 06:10.760
Got it!

06:10.760 --> 06:12.180
Thank you!

06:12.180 --> 06:13.260
That means...

06:13.260 --> 06:17.690
I'm sorry, Masami. I can't fight with Nee-sama anymore.

06:17.690 --> 06:20.400
I cannot betray my master.

06:20.400 --> 06:21.440
Hey!

06:21.440 --> 06:23.900
Mimi, Gettan, whose side are you on?

06:23.900 --> 06:25.320
Let's decide with a vote!

06:25.320 --> 06:27.400
Who wants to help out Masami?

06:27.400 --> 06:28.400
Here!

06:28.400 --> 06:29.740
That's it!

06:29.740 --> 06:31.530
Th-That's no fair!

06:31.530 --> 06:33.410
Tyranny of the majority!

06:33.410 --> 06:35.660
Will you help us out, Aoi-san?

06:35.660 --> 06:36.620
Of course.

06:36.620 --> 06:38.000
But before that...

06:38.000 --> 06:41.710
If you're gonna make me go to the
Basketball Club's practice, then I refuse.

06:41.710 --> 06:45.840
We <i>did</i> join the club, but we get to decide whether we want to practice together with them.

06:45.840 --> 06:48.420
I see. That's just how it is, huh?

06:48.420 --> 06:50.340
Putting that aside...

06:50.340 --> 06:52.720
It's been on our minds for a while now but...

06:52.720 --> 06:56.310
You're only in high school, but those are magnificent.

06:58.060 --> 06:59.480
Yeah! That's my Masami!

06:59.480 --> 07:01.850
We all yearn for that size!

07:03.230 --> 07:04.900
S-Stop it!

07:04.900 --> 07:07.690
Huh? It's harder than I thought.

07:07.690 --> 07:09.360
Isn't that because of her brassiere?

07:09.650 --> 07:11.160
Brassiere?

07:11.160 --> 07:13.870
Nee-sama might need to get one soon.

07:16.450 --> 07:18.790
Stop it! If you keep on rubbing them...

07:19.370 --> 07:21.120
I'm home!

07:21.120 --> 07:22.210
Do we have guests over?

07:22.500 --> 07:23.920
Oh, Nii-tan!

07:23.920 --> 07:27.920
We're rubbing Aoi-san's breasts right now, why don't you join in?

07:27.920 --> 07:29.380
I'm fine.

07:31.380 --> 07:33.550
Hey! Are you idiots!?

07:33.550 --> 07:35.680
Stop doing weird things!

07:35.680 --> 07:38.770
Natsuhi-kun! Stop! Don't come in right now!

07:39.730 --> 07:42.730
Oh! Nii-tan, welcome!

07:51.150 --> 07:55.030
Natsuhi-kun? Natsuhi-kun!

07:58.410 --> 08:00.540
We've got the cabbage and the eggs!

08:00.540 --> 08:01.460
Cabbage!

08:01.460 --> 08:02.790
Oh!

08:29.690 --> 08:32.650
Shrimp, shrimp, shrimp...

08:37.530 --> 08:40.790
One, two! One, two!

08:41.160 --> 08:42.910
Stop that, Hina!

08:54.970 --> 08:56.050
Got it, everyone?

08:56.050 --> 08:58.760
Nagatsuka's going down! Let's do our best!

08:58.760 --> 09:00.350
Yeah!

09:08.190 --> 09:09.860
Hey!

09:29.630 --> 09:30.800
Good.

09:49.400 --> 09:51.270
Thanks, Dad.

09:51.270 --> 09:55.240
Sushi Fuji's fried tofu has to be made by you, after all.

09:59.030 --> 10:02.240
Hey, do you think we can beat Saki?

10:02.990 --> 10:06.710
I'm only one year younger than her, but she can do anything.

10:06.710 --> 10:08.870
She's popular, too...

10:08.870 --> 10:11.290
She's amazing...

10:11.290 --> 10:12.670
But...

10:12.670 --> 10:17.260
That's exactly why I don't want to lose. It's because she's amazing.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.260
I...

10:25.640 --> 10:28.140
You'll be fine, Masami.
From Dad

10:30.100 --> 10:32.270
Thank you, Dad.

10:47.040 --> 10:49.420
I didn't expect us to be right next to each other.

10:49.420 --> 10:52.170
We'll see who sells the most, Saki!

10:52.170 --> 10:53.540
It's a duel! A duel!

10:53.880 --> 10:57.300
Jeez, you're all so stupid.

10:59.840 --> 11:03.220
I'm sorry, they just won't listen to me.

11:03.220 --> 11:04.970
Don't worry about it.

11:04.970 --> 11:07.680
We do our thing, they do theirs. It's all good.

11:07.680 --> 11:11.190
We just want our customers to be satisfied, right?

11:11.190 --> 11:11.980
Yeah.

11:11.980 --> 11:14.770
Thanks, everyone.

11:16.360 --> 11:19.740
Please wait here to enter!

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Bust size

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Starting to grow out a bit.

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Rival

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Nagatsuka Saki

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Name

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Fujii Masami

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Date of birth

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Blood type

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Class

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
5th Year, Class B

11:26.080 --> 11:29.000
Height

11:39.720 --> 11:42.050
H-How is it?

11:43.680 --> 11:46.220
It's good! This is perfect!

11:47.810 --> 11:52.480
I knew we were gonna make something awesome!

11:52.480 --> 11:56.570
Hmph! Ours is way better!

11:57.690 --> 11:58.860
Look!

11:58.860 --> 12:01.200
Oh! So cute!

12:01.200 --> 12:03.490
Yeah! That looks pretty nice!

12:03.490 --> 12:06.620
How's our Five-Faced Inari?

12:06.620 --> 12:09.540
The fried tofu and the rice were all made by my father!

12:09.540 --> 12:11.000
Wow!

12:11.160 --> 12:14.710
This will be popular to both adults and kids!

12:15.500 --> 12:17.880
Relax while you still can.

12:18.090 --> 12:23.180
We'll lure all of the customers to us and leave you empty!

12:26.390 --> 12:27.680
Jeez.

12:27.680 --> 12:31.020
She just yaps on and on about her sushi.

12:36.900 --> 12:42.990
The Suzuran Shopping Street S-Grade Gourmet Fair will now begin!

12:42.990 --> 12:45.200
I-I'm getting kinda nervous.

12:45.200 --> 12:48.240
Yeah, I want to sell at least one first.

12:53.040 --> 12:57.130
Huh? I found a pair of twins who I recognize!

12:58.790 --> 12:59.800
It's you!

12:59.800 --> 13:00.880
From back then...

13:00.880 --> 13:01.920
"You?"

13:01.920 --> 13:04.220
Kinda cocky for a pair of losers.

13:04.220 --> 13:07.010
But I guess I never told you my name.

13:07.010 --> 13:10.390
You two were just too weak, so I never got the chance to.

13:13.020 --> 13:15.890
Don't make those scary faces.

13:15.890 --> 13:18.360
My name is Ashihara Rena.

13:18.360 --> 13:21.070
I'm a fith-year at Suzuridani Girls' Academy.

13:21.070 --> 13:22.150
Nice to meet you.

13:22.150 --> 13:23.650
Suzuridani?

13:24.360 --> 13:26.660
Hey, is she the one?

13:26.660 --> 13:29.660
Yes, the one we need to get revenge on!

13:29.660 --> 13:30.910
Revenge?

13:31.830 --> 13:34.330
What cocky talk!

13:34.330 --> 13:36.620
You two lost so badly last time.

13:41.300 --> 13:43.300
Order something already.

13:43.300 --> 13:45.920
We're busy now.

13:45.920 --> 13:49.800
Hey! Stop lecturing me already, you cocky losers!

13:50.300 --> 13:52.180
I don't like it.

13:53.390 --> 13:56.060
Hey! Are you listening to me?

13:56.600 --> 13:58.350
Losers!

13:58.350 --> 14:00.060
Hey, hey, hey!

14:00.060 --> 14:00.860
And then...

14:04.740 --> 14:06.240
I'm sorry.

14:06.240 --> 14:08.160
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

14:08.160 --> 14:10.450
You made me drop my lollipop!

14:11.530 --> 14:12.530
Huh?

14:17.120 --> 14:19.460
Wow, my bad.

14:19.460 --> 14:20.880
But what a nice shot.

14:20.880 --> 14:22.290
Stop fooling around!

14:22.540 --> 14:26.300
Dad made this fried tofu... And now...

14:26.880 --> 14:28.840
Masami-chan, calm down!

14:28.840 --> 14:29.840
That was an accident!

14:30.220 --> 14:31.680
Yes, yes, an accident.

14:31.680 --> 14:34.060
Just an unlucky accident.

14:34.060 --> 14:35.770
Stop it already!

14:35.770 --> 14:38.230
Properly apologize to Masami!

14:38.230 --> 14:41.980
Even if it was an accident, you should be more considerate!

14:41.980 --> 14:45.780
Can't you see that Masami's sad?

14:47.030 --> 14:48.360
What's with you all?

14:48.360 --> 14:49.950
What a pain.

14:49.950 --> 14:52.530
I don't know anything! It wasn't my fault!

14:52.530 --> 14:53.740
See ya!

14:53.740 --> 14:55.740
Wait!

15:10.720 --> 15:13.850
We can't serve this anymore.

15:21.350 --> 15:25.770
Even though Dad spent so many hours on that...

15:25.770 --> 15:28.530
Even though we thought up this together...

15:41.370 --> 15:43.130
Stand up, Masami!

15:56.350 --> 15:57.720
Saki...

15:57.720 --> 15:59.020
Wh-What do you want?

15:59.270 --> 16:03.350
I know how you feel, but this isn't the time to feel down.

16:03.350 --> 16:07.020
We need to make food for our customers.

16:07.570 --> 16:09.150
You are the poster girl for Fuji Sushi, right?

16:10.070 --> 16:12.150
But the fried tofu...

16:12.150 --> 16:15.070
You still have the mixed sushi rice, right? Then everything's fine.

16:15.320 --> 16:20.080
After all, Sushi Fuji's mixed sushi rice is the best! It'll surely sell!

16:20.700 --> 16:22.830
And who knows that the best?

16:26.460 --> 16:29.250
B-But we only have the rice...

16:29.250 --> 16:30.920
You're right.

16:30.920 --> 16:32.880
Hey, can all of you come over here?

16:33.300 --> 16:34.680
What is it?

16:34.680 --> 16:36.220
Need our help?

16:36.220 --> 16:38.310
Yes, we need your ideas.

16:38.310 --> 16:40.640
How can we use this mixed sushi rice to make an S-Grade gourmet?

16:40.850 --> 16:41.890
Oh!

16:41.890 --> 16:45.270
Food again? I'll think hard!

16:45.270 --> 16:48.020
We can only use what we have, then.

16:48.020 --> 16:52.150
We have eggs, shrimps, vegetables...

16:52.150 --> 16:56.320
H-Hey, wait! Those are all from your store, right?

16:56.320 --> 16:59.030
S-Stop this! Don't do this!

16:59.030 --> 17:01.250
We aren't doing this for your sake.

17:01.250 --> 17:02.290
Then why?

17:02.540 --> 17:05.710
We're doing this for the customers of Sushi Fuji.

17:11.800 --> 17:16.130
We can't make inari sushi anymore, but let's all think about something else.

17:16.130 --> 17:18.890
Something new using the mixed sushi rice.

17:19.050 --> 17:21.640
But what about your pancakes?

17:21.640 --> 17:27.400
We've already learned a lot by thinking about it together.

17:27.400 --> 17:31.190
It's not important whether we sell a lot or not.

17:31.190 --> 17:32.650
Right, everybody?

17:32.650 --> 17:33.610
Yep!

17:33.610 --> 17:34.530
Oh!

17:34.530 --> 17:36.530
We can make it anytime!

17:40.160 --> 17:43.290
We need to use the sushi rice in an authentic way...

17:43.660 --> 17:48.750
It's easier to eat if we wrap it up like inari sushi.

17:48.750 --> 17:50.880
How about rice balls?

17:50.880 --> 17:54.300
But that might not look authentic anymore.

17:55.800 --> 17:58.430
Isn't there a good idea somewhere?

17:58.430 --> 17:59.800
Maybe if we use only rice!

17:59.800 --> 18:02.810
Stop being an idiot and think properly.

18:03.140 --> 18:06.140
Oh? Rice? Baka?

18:06.140 --> 18:07.890
Rice baka?

18:07.890 --> 18:09.560
Rice burger?

18:10.440 --> 18:13.360
Rice burger! Hina, that might work!

18:30.170 --> 18:32.340
Nee-sama, that looks great.

18:32.340 --> 18:33.800
I'm done!

18:35.300 --> 18:39.840
Nagatsuka and Sushi Fuji's special
collaboration menu will be on sale soon!

18:39.840 --> 18:42.140
Please try us out!

18:42.140 --> 18:43.470
Try us out!

18:44.060 --> 18:45.970
Welcome!

18:45.970 --> 18:48.230
Yes, that's right.

18:48.230 --> 18:49.690
Thank you very much.

18:49.690 --> 18:50.480
Do your best.

18:51.060 --> 18:53.400
Thank you very much!

19:03.370 --> 19:05.240
Thank you very much!

19:08.500 --> 19:10.620
Please have a look!

19:16.340 --> 19:18.590
Seems like they're fine now.

19:18.590 --> 19:19.760
Yeah.

19:33.770 --> 19:36.900
Oh! The scrubbing feels so nice!

19:36.900 --> 19:38.570
Scrub! Scrub!

19:41.530 --> 19:42.200
Go!

19:42.910 --> 19:44.070
Back at ya!

19:50.540 --> 19:52.670
Saki...

19:52.670 --> 19:55.340
Um... for today...

19:56.380 --> 19:57.710
Th-Thanks.

20:00.050 --> 20:01.630
You're welcome.

20:05.640 --> 20:09.890
I guess we'll come to the Basketball Club's practice tomorrow.

20:12.310 --> 20:14.310
U-Us, too?

20:14.310 --> 20:15.230
Yeah.

20:30.620 --> 20:34.080
One, two, three, four...

20:34.080 --> 20:37.670
Five, six, seven, eight.

20:37.670 --> 20:39.090
Two, two...

20:40.130 --> 20:42.010
We finally got all ten.

20:42.010 --> 20:45.840
But it'll take some time for them to be a team.

20:46.050 --> 20:50.350
Well, just getting them to come to
practice is already a huge step forward.

20:52.350 --> 20:53.940
Where the hell did you come from?!

20:53.940 --> 20:55.850
What are you saying?

20:55.850 --> 20:59.320
I even brought you this super important letter.

20:59.320 --> 21:00.820
Super important?

21:03.070 --> 21:04.530
Miho-nee, this is...

21:06.740 --> 21:08.530
Gather around, everyone!

21:10.870 --> 21:13.000
Um, Subaru-san?

21:15.500 --> 21:18.590
Keishin Academy Girls' Basketball Club

21:18.590 --> 21:21.420
has now officially entered the regional
tournament for the national tournament.

21:22.510 --> 21:23.720
So that means...

21:23.720 --> 21:25.380
We can take part in the tournament?

21:25.800 --> 21:27.010
Yeah.

21:27.010 --> 21:29.430
And our first round opponent will be...

21:29.430 --> 21:30.890
Suzuridani Girls Academy!

21:34.890 --> 21:38.150
Suzuridani... Ashihara Rena!

21:38.150 --> 21:40.270
This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!

21:40.270 --> 21:42.900
With this, we can get our revenge.

21:42.900 --> 21:44.900
Both yours and ours.

21:48.280 --> 21:51.370
Okay! Let's start practicing!

21:51.370 --> 21:52.950
Let's do it, everyone!

21:53.330 --> 21:55.960
Yeah!

21:56.560 --> 21:59.310
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

21:59.310 --> 22:00.850
Rolling! Rolling!

22:00.850 --> 22:03.770
Keep on bouncing!

22:02.060 --> 22:04.780
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

22:04.780 --> 22:07.190
Elementary schoolers are the best!

22:07.190 --> 22:07.570
Yay!

22:11.660 --> 22:16.660
Our bodies and our hearts are size SS,

22:17.160 --> 22:22.580
but our dreams can be size LL, can't they? Can't they?

22:22.580 --> 22:27.970
Adolescents have lots of troubles,

22:27.970 --> 22:33.550
but we'll overcome them together.

22:33.550 --> 22:38.980
I want to get even better!

22:34.350 --> 22:35.720
Even

22:35.720 --> 22:37.060
better!

22:38.980 --> 22:46.650
I want to see your face when I surprise you!

22:39.980 --> 22:40.480
Ooh!

22:41.270 --> 22:41.710
Wow!

22:46.860 --> 22:49.570
Just keep on spinning!

22:49.570 --> 22:53.490
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:53.490 --> 22:57.160
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:56.540 --> 22:58.080
I'll keep going!

22:57.790 --> 23:00.500
Just keep on spinning!

23:00.500 --> 23:04.460
The universe is one big basketball court!

23:04.460 --> 23:07.880
I want you to receive it.

23:07.170 --> 23:08.130
Ready, and!

23:07.880 --> 23:09.720
Pass! Pass! Pass!

23:10.130 --> 23:12.130
Please take it!

23:13.390 --> 23:16.140
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:16.140 --> 23:17.680
Rolling! Rolling!

23:17.680 --> 23:20.560
Keep on bouncing!

23:18.810 --> 23:21.560
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:21.560 --> 23:24.020
Elementary schoolers are the best!

23:24.020 --> 23:25.980
Yay!

23:26.250 --> 23:28.170
That Rena pisses me off!

23:28.170 --> 23:29.880
We'll beat her to a pulp!

